                  <annotatedElement xmi:idref="CDIFDataDescription.CdifConceptOrTermOrString"/>
                  <body>Union shorthand for 'a plain string OR the CdifConceptOrTerm 3-way union (skos:Concept @id-ref | schema:DefinedTerm | inline cdif:Concept)'.</body>
               </ownedComment>
               <name>CdifConceptOrTermOrString</name>
